                    "text": "in 2 (signal/float) Cutoff in Hz @min samplerate*0.00022 @max samplerate*0.458334"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\nrequire(\"evi_biquads.genexpr\");\r\n\r\n/*\r\n    0   eviBiquadCoeffLowpass                   cutoff, Q\r\n    1   eviBiquadCoeffLowpassGain               cutoff, gain, Q    (default)\r\n    2   eviBiquadCoeffLowpassAnalog1            cutoff, Q\r\n    3   eviBiquadCoeffLowpassAnalog2            cutoff, Q\r\n    4   eviBiquadCoeffButterworthLowpass        cutoff\r\n    5   eviBiquadCoeffButterworthLowpassGain    cutoff, gain\r\n*/\r\nParam   filter(1, min=0, max=5);\r\nfilt    = int(filter);\r\nreset   = delta(change(filt)) < 0;\r\n\r\na0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = 0;\r\nif (filt == 1) {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffLowpassGain(in2, dbtoa(in3), in4);\r\n}\r\nelse if (filt == 2) {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffLowpassAnalog1(in2, in4);\r\n}\r\nelse if (filt == 3) {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffLowpassAnalog2(in2, in4);\r\n}\r\nelse if (filt == 4) {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffButterworthLowpass(in2);\r\n}\r\nelse if (filt == 5) {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffButterworthLowpassGain(in2, dbtoa(in3));\r\n}\r\nelse {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffLowpass(in2, in4);\r\n}\r\n\r\nout1    = biquadDf2reset(in1, a0, a1, a2, b1, b2, reset);\r\n\r\n",
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "<Monospaced>",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
